OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAGhosts of Drumcree wakened as
OL,4,Aquestions loom over Stormont's future
OL,5,
OL,6,FOver many years of reporting, and on
OL,7,Fmany roads in this place, I have seen
OL,8,Fthe scattered debris of politics,
OL,9,Fpolicing and parading; seen it at those
OL,10,Fflash-points and 'clash-points' where
OL,11,Fcontested marches have been met by
OL,12,Fprotest.
OL,14,FRubble on the roads. The spent casings
OL,15,Fof plastic bullets. The scorch marks
OL,16,Fleft by burned out vehicles. The
OL,17,Finjured. All of this in twisted picture
OL,18,Fframes that display and exhibit the
OL,19,Fopposite of peace.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
PN,41602
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1790587558
OL,1,W5j 5Q7k jjs%wsj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAGhosts of Drumcree wakened as
OL,4,Aquestions loom over Stormont's future
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis is not the debris we are looking
OL,7,Fat in television coverage and
OL,8,Fphotographs from Portadown.
OL,10,FThe shrapnel is in the angry words that
OL,11,Fare being spoken. And, once again,
OL,12,Feverything is on the line - the new
OL,13,Fpolicing project approaching its 25th
OL,14,Fbirthday, the fractured and fraught
OL,15,Fpolitics at Stormont and that thing we
OL,16,Fcall community relations.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
